        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ========================================================= -->
    <!-- ENGINE 1: STRATEGIC & LIQUIDITY (C-LEVEL COMMAND) -->
    <!-- ========================================================= -->
    <div id='engine-strategic' class='engine-panel active'>
        <div class='report-card'>
            <div class='report-card-title'>
                <span>1.A METRIK LIKUIDITAS &amp; KESEHATAN KAS MAKRO</span>
                <span class='badge badge-blue'>Working Capital Matrix</span>
            </div>

            <div style='display:grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap:20px; margin-bottom:20px;'>
                <div class='diag-box'>
                    <h4><span>Cash Conversion Cycle (CCC) Breakdown</span> <span class='badge badge-blue'>" . round($ccc, 1) . " Hari</span></h4>
                    <p>Siklus konversi kas mengukur berapa hari modal kerja tertahan sejak pembelian bahan baku, penyimpanan di gudang, penjualan, hingga uang piutang masuk kembali ke rekening bank:</p>
                    <div style='margin-top:12px; font-size:12px;'>
                        <div style='display:flex; justify-content:space-between; padding:4px 0;'><span>1. Days Inventory Outstanding (DIO / DSI):</span><strong>" . round($dio, 1) . " Hari</strong></div>
                        <div style='display:flex; justify-content:space-between; padding:4px 0;'><span>2. Days Sales Outstanding (DSO - Penagihan Piutang):</span><strong>" . round($dso, 1) . " Hari</strong></div>
                        <div style='display:flex; justify-content:space-between; padding:4px 0; color:#16a34a;'><span>3. Days Payable Outstanding (DPO - Pembayaran Supplier):</span><strong>(" . round($dpo, 1) . " Hari)</strong></div>
                        <div style='display:flex; justify-content:space-between; padding:6px 0; border-top:1px dashed #cbd5e1; font-weight:800; font-size:13px; color:#2563eb;'>
                            <span>Net Cash Conversion Cycle (CCC):</span>
                            <span>" . round($ccc, 1) . " Hari</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class='diag-box' style='border-color:" . ($isCashBleeding ? "#fca5a5" : "#86efac") . "; background:" . ($isCashBleeding ? "#fef2f2" : "#f0fdf4") . ";'>
                    <h4>
                        <span style='color:" . ($isCashBleeding ? "#991b1b" : "#166534") . ";'>DSO vs DPO: Cash Bleeding Diagnostic</span>
                        <span class='badge " . ($isCashBleeding ? "badge-red" : "badge-green") . "'>" . ($isCashBleeding ? "BLEEDING ACTIVE" : "BALANCED") . "</span>
                    </h4>
                    <p style='color:" . ($isCashBleeding ? "#7f1d1d" : "#14532d") . ";'>
                        " . ($isCashBleeding ? 
                        "<strong>Peringatan Pendarahan Kas Internal:</strong> Waktu penagihan piutang konsumen (DSO " . round($dso, 1) . " hari) lebih lambat <strong>" . round($dsoDpoGap, 1) . " hari</strong> dibandingkan tempo pelunasan utang ke supplier (DPO " . round($dpo, 1) . " hari). Perusahaan harus menambal defisit arus kas ini menggunakan kas cadangan atau fasilitas kredit perbankan." :
                        "<strong>Arus Kas Sehat:</strong> Pembayaran ke supplier lebih panjang daripada waktu penagihan piutang dari konsumen. Perusahaan beroperasi dengan modal kerja gratis dari supplier.") . "
                    </p>
                    <div style='margin-top:10px; font-size:12px;'>
                        <div style='display:flex; justify-content:space-between;'><span>Gap Defisit Penagihan:</span><strong>" . round($dsoDpoGap, 1) . " Hari</strong></div>
                        <div style='display:flex; justify-content:space-between;'><span>Rekomendasi Kebijakan:</span><strong>Perketat Term of Payment (TOP) Konsumen</strong></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div style='display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap:16px;'>
                <div class='diag-box'>
                    <h4><span>Quick Ratio (Acid-Test Ratio)</span> <span class='badge badge-green'>" . number_format($quickRatio, 2) . "x</span></h4>
