                    <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
                        <h4 style="margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #1e293b;">
                            <i class="fa fa-columns text-primary"></i> Perbandingan Visual Data Transaksi (Hasil <code>blobDecode()</code>)
